# Route: guide 16 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Undead
# (1199 of 1215 eligible quests, 157.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 34 to
# 36, 13 quests, 1.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Mulgore, Thousand Needles): Skywatcher Plateau -> Windfury Ridge ->
# Thunder Bluff -> The Shimmering Flats -> Windbreak Canyon -> The Shimmering
# Flats -> Windbreak Canyon.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Leaders of the Fang (914), A Vengeful Fate (1102),
# Searching for the Lost Satchel (5722), Testing an Enemy's Strength (5723),
# Gahz'rilla (2770).

